From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blackhat-7 <44942105+blackhat-7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:47:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 16/33] WIP disk tier: cleanups after the first build (not yet
 built with HIP; the unit test passes)

- per_block()/divides() instead of chunk_bytes() with an out-parameter
- a temporary file is tmp-<final name> (one writer per folder); manifests are named by the
  writer's own generator: no global random state
- drop the never-read stats (restored, dropped, read_bytes)
- a written image is freed outside the store's lock; the log line goes out before finish() returns

build-hip/strata is still b16c1ade's.
